  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 539f376c48a44fc894c044893a93b560, type: 3}
  m_Name: HowToGetBetter
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueText: 
  dialogue:
  - isPlayer: 0
    text: There are many ways to improve, by killing you get rewarded.
  - isPlayer: 0
    text: Use that reward in the upgrade tree in camp, choose wisely what would help
      you.
  - isPlayer: 1
    text: Upgrades? I didn't see anything.
  - isPlayer: 0
    text: Pay more attention, you can interact with both the camp and the camp fire.
  - isPlayer: 1
    text: What else can i do?
  - isPlayer: 0
    text: As you may have notices the sword has patterns, different combo attacks
      you can use
  - isPlayer: 0
    text: Learn them, become better with the timing, once mastered you will stand
      a chance
  nextNode: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4a1bc0cacd72202409a6f458694b2db0, type: 2}
